ue":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T14:34:57-08:00","id":336311,"title":"","content":"Over my desk is a framed copy of one of the original Aeon (not Trinity) promo posters. <i>A battle rages across the stars... you are the weapon</i>.<br /> <br /> And in the library, one of the Wraith promo posters. <i>There's a storm that's always screaming under the skin of the world. Sometimes it comes looking for you...</i><br /> <br /> But my best WWGS swag is the two Team Vlad Canis shirts from the Origins '99 booth crew.<br /> <br /> - C.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Clayton A. Oliver | Formerly Ubiquitous<br /> <br /> <i>When the half-light starts to rise/And the long gone come back again<br /> After the shortcuts and the highs/Comes the pain<br /> And the rain</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2966-tegyrius","name":"Tegyrius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2966_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T18:23:34-08:00","id":336553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/333078-20-years-of-swag-share-your-swag-memorabilia?p=336153#post336153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have both Mage Tarots (Awakening and Ascension) and they're on my &quot;never give up even in the direst of circumstances&quot; list. It's a list of two...<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm.... I have both of those as well.... but that's far from the &quot;never give up list&quot;. I could definitely be persuaded to part with either or both for the knowledge they are going to loving homes and sufficient renumeration.... <br /> <br /> The &quot;never give up&quot; list is for things like the first edition copy of Alice In Wonderland and Through the Looking Glass, my great-grandfather's railroad watch, that sort of thing. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T18:36:57-08:00","id":336562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/333078-20-years-of-swag-share-your-swag-memorabilia?p=336096#post336096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Offer me some people crushing money and I'll consider letting you have it.</div> </div> </div> </div>If I ever win the lottery, I'll let you know. As it stands, I can't afford to buy myself winter boots, and so am hoping the winter stays mild in my neck of the woods.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T22:23:45-08:00","id":336777,"title":"","content":"Some of the links appear to be broken. Don't have anything right now to share here, but surely feeling nostalgic about this feat. It's been 20 years. Can't believe at first. And as someone mentioned above, I too have a copy of The Silver Record. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4280-randymagic","name":"RandyMagic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T00:44:12-08:00","id":336825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/333078-20-years-of-swag-share-your-swag-memorabilia?p=336553#post336553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The &quot;never give up&quot; list is for things like the first edition copy of Alice In Wonderland and Through the Looking Glass, my great-grandfather's railroad watch, that sort of thing.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well, like anything else, it's all relative. I suppose that's more my &quot;<i>WoD stuff </i>I'll never give up even in the...etc.&quot; list, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T07:11:19-08:00","id":336986,"title":"","content":"So much.... I have all the in character supplements - hardback Book of Nod, Revelations of the Dark Mother, Erciyes Fragments, Chronicles of the Black Labyrinth, The Silver Record, The Fragile Path, Hunter Apocrypha, and Days of Fire.<br /> <br /> For novels, I have Splendor Falls, The Toybox, Shadows on the Hill, Court of All Kings, Pomegranates Full and Fine, and Lucifer's Shadow.<br /> <br /> Pins: the Vampire ankh, the Werewolf claw marks, the Mage prime symbol, the Wraith key, the Changeling butterfly, the KotE symbol, and the original World of Darkness symbol.<br /> <br /> Posters: Vampire revised, Mage revised, Changeling 1e and 2e, and Hunter<br /> <br /> Cards: the Mage tarot revised, a complete collection of Changeling cantrip cards, a complete collection of Arcadia: King Ironheart's Madness, five cards short of a complete set of Arcadia: The Wyld Hunt<br /> <br /> Original art: Ron Spencer's portraits of High King David and Faerilyth from Noblesse Oblige and a portrait of my Changeling group by Melissa Uran (my avatar comes from that picture).<br /> <br /> Miscellaneous: promotional booklets for Vampire revised and Mage revised, they weren't the quickstarts, but they give an overview the games' settings and are very pretty","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T13:30:47-08:00","id":337374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/333078-20-years-of-swag-share-your-swag-memorabilia?p=336825#post336825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, like anything else, it's all relative. I suppose that's more my &quot;<i>WoD stuff </i>I'll never give up even in the...etc.&quot; list, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough.... I think I'd hand on to some of the core rulebooks with tooth and talon moreso than the pretty pretty cards. That way I can still play. <br /> <br /> Having said that though, I think it would be a wrestling match if someone wanted my Mage coffee mug. I USE that thing pretty much every day. It's not just gaming swag, it the vessel for my daily dose of Quintessence!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T18:00:31-08:00","id":337597,"title":"","content":"I realized the OP called for pictures. Here are most of them, but the posters are a little inaccessible at the moment.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5p